DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
8392::$$$message_0060_0000_0000$$$::...It's a day off at school, so there's not many people.[lr]::
8393::$$$message_0060_0000_0001$$$::I hear the brass band club play in the distance with other kinds of wind instruments mixed together when...::
8394::$$$message_0060_0001_0000$$$::"...What on earth?"[lr]::
8395::$$$message_0060_0001_0001$$$::Like a beast frantically running through[line len=2][lr]::
8396::$$$message_0060_0001_0002$$$::Oww![se storage=se217.wav]::
8397::$$$message_0060_0002_0000$$$::"Ouch! Watch where you're going!"[lr]::
8398::$$$message_0060_0002_0001$$$::"That's my line! Is that for you to say who jumped out of nowhere!?"[lr]::
8399::$$$message_0060_0002_0002$$$::"You also shouldn't be standing there blankly! Emiya[line len=2][cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服02a(近)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=蒔寺制服02a(近) textoff=0]Yikes."[lr]::
8400::$$$message_0060_0002_0003$$$::Fuyuki's self-proclaimed "black panther" got up first.[lr]::
8401::$$$message_0060_0002_0004$$$::It was a sudden greeting by Kaede Makidera from the track club.::
8402::$$$message_0060_0003_0000$$$::"Oh, it's you, Makidera. Look straight ahead while living[line len=2]I mean, running."[lr]::
8403::$$$message_0060_0003_0001$$$::"Yeah, I'm always looking straight when I run. If you were also looking straight ahead, you could've dodged that."[lr]::
8404::$$$message_0060_0003_0002$$$::"What do you think I am[line len=2]Hnng..."[lr]::
8405::$$$message_0060_0003_0003$$$::My butt is pathetically on the floor.[lr]::
8406::$$$message_0060_0003_0004$$$::I feel full of humiliation, since Makidera is looking down at me.::
8407::$$$message_0060_0004_0000$$$::"Geez, Emiya. What if I fell in love with you from this?"[lr]::
8408::$$$message_0060_0004_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
8409::$$$message_0060_0004_0002$$$::"...I'm joking. Well, since it's you, you won't have any injuries."[lr]::
8410::$$$message_0060_0004_0003$$$::I'm more worried about Makidera, the ace of track, than myself.[lr]::
8411::$$$message_0060_0004_0004$$$::She looks fine at a glance, but... I bet she would push herself and hide the fact that she's injured.::
8412::$$$message_0060_0005_0000$$$::"This season is important, right? Did you hit or twist anything?"[lr]::
8413::$$$message_0060_0005_0001$$$::"Ugh, I made Emiya worry about me... But I'm totally fine. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服03a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=蒔寺制服03a(中) time=300 textoff=0]Here, Emiya..."[lr]::
8414::$$$message_0060_0005_0002$$$::She must've felt bad that I was on the floor this whole time, as she offers me a hand.::
8415::$$$message_0060_0006_0000$$$::I try to stand up without her help[se storage=se370.wav], and my finger gets caught on a thin chain on the floor.[lr]::
8416::$$$message_0060_0006_0001$$$::"Oh?"::
8417::$$$message_0060_0007_0000$$$::Tohsaka's pendant that was still in the pocket of my clothes.[lr]::
8418::$$$message_0060_0007_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01g(中) textoff=0]I try to put it away in a hurry, but I notice that I'm being watched with a suspicious stare.::
8419::$$$message_0060_0008_0000$$$::"Makidera, this is..."[lr]::
8420::$$$message_0060_0008_0001$$$::It must've been ill-matched that I have such jewelry with me.[lr]::
8421::$$$message_0060_0008_0002$$$::But, Makidera's stare isn't any normal stare.::
8422::$$$message_0060_0009_0000$$$::"Tohsaka had the same one.[lr]::
8423::$$$message_0060_0009_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=蒔寺制服01c(中) time=300 textoff=0]...Why do you have it?"[lr]::
8424::$$$message_0060_0009_0002$$$::"Uh... This? It's a long story."[lr]::
8425::$$$message_0060_0009_0003$$$::It's more of an absurd story than a long one, so I can't talk about it in detail.[lr]::
8426::$$$message_0060_0009_0004$$$::This pendant is a memento of my father, and the design just coincidentally happens to be the same... Should I forge such a story right now?::
8427::$$$message_0060_0010_0000$$$::"Could it be that you..."[lr]::
8428::$$$message_0060_0010_0001$$$::"I didn't steal Tohsaka's; she has the same thing on right now."[lr]::
8429::$$$message_0060_0010_0002$$$::"So it's matching, huh...? Hm... I see..."[lr]::
8430::$$$message_0060_0010_0003$$$::Makidera's laugh seems to be strangely delighted.[lr]::
8431::$$$message_0060_0010_0004$$$::As if to say that it's way more suspicious that I have matching pendants with Tohsaka.::
8432::$$$message_0060_0011_0000$$$::"Man, aren't you a stud?"[lr]::
8433::$$$message_0060_0011_0001$$$::"...What are you scheming, Makidera?"[lr]::
8434::$$$message_0060_0011_0002$$$::"Wow, to think that you and Tohsaka have matching jewelry... Muahahaha."::
8435::$$$message_0060_0012_0000$$$::It seems like some unsettling plan is being plotted within this black panther.[lr]::
8436::$$$message_0060_0012_0001$$$::I have the same pendant as Tohsaka.[lr]::
8437::$$$message_0060_0012_0002$$$::If such a rumor is spread, who knows what kind of horrors the Homurahara boys would rain down upon me!?[lr]::
8438::$$$message_0060_0012_0003$$$::A cold sweat trickles down my forehead.[lr]::
8439::$$$message_0060_0012_0004$$$::A nauseousness weighs my stomach down.::
8440::$$$message_0060_0013_0000$$$::"Hey, Emiya. You scratch my back, and I'll scratch yours! Um, see, you know! I can pretend like I haven't seen anything!"[lr]::
8441::$$$message_0060_0013_0001$$$::"...Makidera... What are your exchange conditions? A crepe? Or is it anmitsu?"::
8442::$$$message_0060_0014_0000$$$::"No, not anything like that.[lr]::
8443::$$$message_0060_0014_0001$$$::Can you tell me where they sell that pendant?"[lr]::
8444::$$$message_0060_0014_0002$$$::"Huh? What are you going to do with that info?"::
8445::$$$message_0060_0015_0000$$$::"I-it doesn't matter.[lr]::
8446::$$$message_0060_0015_0001$$$::You see, this kind of tacky design is actually kinda cool. I don't know, like I kinda want one now too.[lr]::
8447::$$$message_0060_0015_0002$$$::You bought that at some shop, right? Tell me the name."::
8448::$$$message_0060_0016_0000$$$::"...Sorry, I don't know either."[lr]::
8449::$$$message_0060_0016_0001$$$::This time it isn't a lie or anything, but that's the only answer I have.[lr]::
8450::$$$message_0060_0016_0002$$$::It's not something Tohsaka bought either, and its origin is something inherited from ancestors.[lr]::
8451::$$$message_0060_0016_0003$$$::...This isn't an object that can be bought from somewhere.::
8452::$$$message_0060_0017_0000$$$::"...Hey, Emiya."[lr]::
8453::$$$message_0060_0017_0001$$$::"What?"[lr]::
8454::$$$message_0060_0017_0002$$$::"Did Tohsaka give that to you as a present, instead of you giving it as a present?"[lr]::
8455::$$$message_0060_0017_0003$$$::"Yeah, let's just leave it at that."[lr]::
8456::$$$message_0060_0017_0004$$$::It occurred to me how strange reality was when I realized there were two[line len=2]::
8457::$$$message_0060_0018_0000$$$::Ow![lr]::
8458::$$$message_0060_0018_0001$$$::This time it's not an accident, but an attack!::
8459::$$$message_0060_0019_0000$$$::"W-what are you doing, Makidera!?"[lr]::
8460::$$$message_0060_0019_0001$$$::"T-this guy! I'll kill him; [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]I'll kill him for sure!"[lr]::
8461::$$$message_0060_0019_0002$$$::"Kill!? Don't think that I'm going to obediently let myself be killed!"[lr]::
8462::$$$message_0060_0019_0003$$$::"Shut[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4] up![lr]::
8463::$$$message_0060_0019_0004$$$::I'll give the bad guy a punishment on behalf of the gods for making Tohsaka put so much money into something so expensive! RAHHH!"::
8464::$$$message_0060_0020_0000$$$::Khh!?[lr]::
8465::$$$message_0060_0020_0001$$$::To think that I would be challenged like this on a day off in the hallway...![lr]::
8466::$$$message_0060_0020_0002$$$::Why the hell is she this mad about Tohsaka and my pendant!?[lr]::
8467::$$$message_0060_0020_0003$$$::I don't know why, but I need to defend myself[line len=2]::
8468::$$$message_0060_0021_0000$$$::"DON'T RUN AWAY, EMIYAAAA!!!"[lr]::
8469::$$$message_0060_0021_0001$$$::"Guh! [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=-12]Stop joking arouuund!!! Oh, you must've hit your head instead of your foot, huh!?"[lr]::
8470::$$$message_0060_0021_0002$$$::"RAHHHHH! In fact, I'll defeat you and obtain experience before I get your rare item!"::
8471::$$$message_0060_0022_0000$$$::The Black Panther of Homurahara closes in on me.[lr]::
8472::$$$message_0060_0022_0001$$$::...Oof... If I meet anyone with a nickname even remotely similar to "panther" in the hallway from now on, I'll run away as fast as I can.::
908397::$$$message_9060_0002_0000$$$::"Ouch! Watch where you're going!"[r]:��6